  <item>
    <title>051. 再谈臣服实验：人生就是一场巨大的Omakase</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e76ffd0208d0bb65fd6a94</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e76ffd0208d0bb65fd6a94</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 12:31:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<br><br><p><span>这一期节目会接着上一次继续分享显化的内容，以及我的臣服实践的感受。</span></p><br><br><p><b><span>本期时间线——</span></b></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><p><span>人生不过是灵魂想要玩的一场游戏体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a></span></p><p><span>显化就是借假修真的过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a></span></p><p><span>我成功显化了想要的生活之后，隐隐觉得还有什么不对的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a></span></p><p><span>我想的愿望落空之后，没想过的事情真的实现了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a></span></p><p><span>真正的显化就是臣服，那么真正的臣服是？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a></span></p><p><span>人生就是一场巨大的Omakase</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a></span></p><p><span>宇宙是希望你直接走捷径，不需要吃苦和牺牲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2219">36:59</a></span></p><p><span>臣服就是放下二元对立</span></p><br><p><span>————————————</span></p><p><b><span>本期背景音乐：</span></b><span>Sam Ock - Keep Me Warm</span></p><p><b><span>小红书/B站/抖音：</span></b><span>罗耍耍Gotta</span></p><p><b><span>联系我：</span></b><span>luoshuashua@qq.com（商业合作请注明平台）</span></p><br><br><br><br>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIaINvTF0AXPHXwSN9u0C.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=37823828&amp;track_id=971741487&amp;uid=146900337&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/9a31-audiofreehighqps/E4/72/GKwRIaINvTF0AXPHXwSN9u0C.m4a" length="24364895" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:09</itunes:duration>
